<title>BELGIUM: Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 6.049 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 6.049 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details about the outcome of its monthly auction BELA</p>
<p>* 6.25 pct, March 2007 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   101.470 / 6.049 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    101.35  to 101.50</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 101.45</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     73.099</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		  4.275 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	   8.120 billion francs</p>
<p>* 5.00 pct, March 2001 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   101.575 / 4.580 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    101.45 to 101.60</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 101.55</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     34.292</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		  10.040 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	   23.885 billion francs</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
